      "message": "docs(post): Carvera names the open hazard after M6; PR refs issue 1616\n\nThe review of a1833e52 requested two changes.\n\n1. The Carvera claim was overstated. After M6 the Carvera still moves\n   X/Y at the exit height of the changer. No source that we read\n   confirms that height. The comment in carvera.cps and the decision\n   file now say that the hazard of issue 1614 stays for the Carvera\n   after M6 until a public source confirms the M6 exit position.\n   The new test the_carvera_script_names_the_open_hazard_after_its_tool_change\n   keeps that note in the script.\n\n2. The PR does not close issue 1616. The decision file says that the\n   Fanuc family (issue 1633) and the Carvera after M6 stay open.\n\nNo change to posted output.\n\nRefs #1616\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
