      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/1616-first-traverse-clearance\n\nMain moved the contour paths (climb direction, PR 1577). Nine golden\nNC files conflicted. Take main's side, then regenerate them with\nWRITE_GOLDEN=1 on the conformance test.\n\nEach file now equals main's version plus one inserted line:\n\"G0 Z5\" before the first X/Y traverse. No other line changed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
